      <title>2026 年 Skills 元年：一文讲透 Skills 是什么、怎么用、去哪里下载（附 8 万&#43; GitHub 资源）</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai002/post/20260814/2026-%E5%B9%B4-Skills-%E5%85%83%E5%B9%B4%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E8%AE%B2%E9%80%8F-Skills-%E6%98%AF%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E6%80%8E%E4%B9%88%E7%94%A8%E5%8E%BB%E5%93%AA%E9%87%8C%E4%B8%8B%E8%BD%BD%E9%99%84-8-%E4%B8%87-GitHub-%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
